[1.9217125829309225, "o", "ield.\r\nmemoryWarning                                                     Send a memory warning to the device.\r\ncaDebug.set <option> <value>                                      Turn a Core Animation debug option on or off.\r\nhinge.get                                                         Read the hinge state.\r\nhinge.set <value>                                                 Fold or unfold a foldable simulator.\r\npermissions.list [bundleId]                                       List permissions for one app or for every app.\r\nlocation.set <lat> <lng>                                          Set the simulated location.\r\nlocation.clear                                                    Stop simulating a location.\r\nhome.springboard                                                  Go to the Home screen.\r\nrotate <value>                                                    Rotate the device.\r\nbutton <value>                                                    Press a hardware button.\r\ncamera.switch <source> [target]    "]
